+// judgeGetters: the shape of carbon/1 is the two week-name checks of a case
+// whose week start is not Monday; under HEGEL_NO_KNOWN=1 those checks are
+// dropped (the week start is still drawn for the other checks) instead of the
+// case being skipped.
+func judgeGetters(j *hzCaseJudge, c getterCase) {
